  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Lankesh vs State Of M.P. on 9 July, 2022 Author: Milind Ramesh Phadke Bench: Milind Ramesh Phadke 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Gwalior Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Milind Ramesh Phadke On The 9th Of July, 2022 Writ Petition No. 3833 of 2012 Between:- Lankesh S/O B.P.Sharma , Aged About 25 Y E A R S , Gram Birampura, Teh.Joura, Distt.Morena (Madhya Pradesh) .....Petitioner (By Shri Sanjay Bahirani - Advocate) And 1. State Of M.P. Th:Its Food Safety Commissioner Vallabh Bhawan, Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) 2. The Adjudication Officer Cum Additional Dist.Magistrate Dist.Morena Mp (Madhya Pradesh) 3. Ku.Rekha Soni [Food Safety Officer] Occupation: Food Safety Administration Department Dist.Morena (Madhya Pradesh) .....Respondents (By Shri Shiraz Quraishi - Ga) This petition coming on for admission this day, th e court passed the following: Order",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Counsel for the petitioner at the outset submits that in exercise of the powers conferred under sub-section (1) of Section 70 of the Food Safety and Standards Act 2006, the State Government had established Food Safety Appellate Tribunal and he has a remedy to prefer an appeal against the order impugned.",
